{"id":"bf0ad86f0f4cd75f","group":"58","path":"58/batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md","title":"Abelian Variety","display":"df-abelian-variety — Abelian Variety","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-abelian-variety","aliases":["58-df-abelian-variety","Abelian Variety"],"display":"df-abelian-variety — Abelian Variety","depends_on":["[[../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md]]","[[../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-abelian-variety"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-abelian-variety</span><span>Abelian Variety</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-abelian-variety — Abelian Variety"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"6046552157f71d9c\" href=\"?note=6046552157f71d9c\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md\">../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"07ee726a6e15b274\" href=\"?note=07ee726a6e15b274\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md\">../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,A,m,i,e\\in V\">\\(k,A,m,i,e\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(\\,\\cdot\\,;\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(\\,\\cdot\\,;\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"6046552157f71d9c\" href=\"?note=6046552157f71d9c\" title=\"../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md\">../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_{(\\cdot)}(\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_{(\\cdot)}(\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"07ee726a6e15b274\" href=\"?note=07ee726a6e15b274\" title=\"../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md\">../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}variety} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m,i,e) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(A,m,i,e)\\land\\exists P,\\tau_Z\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=m(\\langle b,a\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}variety} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m,i,e) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(A,m,i,e)\\land\\exists P,\\tau_Z\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=m(\\langle b,a\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An abelian variety is represented as a projective commutative algebraic group over <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>; projective varieties are irreducible under the upstream convention.</li>\n<li>Complex: <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A \\cong \\mathbb{C}^g/\\Lambda\">\\(A \\cong \\mathbb{C}^g/\\Lambda\\)</span> is a complex torus iff <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H^1(A, \\mathcal{O}) \\cong \\mathbb{C}^g\">\\(H^1(A, \\mathcal{O}) \\cong \\mathbb{C}^g\\)</span></li>\n<li>Polarization: ample divisor class gives Riemann form</li>\n<li>Examples: elliptic curves (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g=1\">\\(g=1\\)</span>), Jacobians of curves (<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"g = g(C)\">\\(g = g(C)\\)</span>)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Mumford, Abelian Varieties</li>\n<li>Hartshorne, Algebraic Geometry</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md","status":"resolved","id":"6046552157f71d9c","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"07ee726a6e15b274","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md","status":"resolved","id":"6046552157f71d9c","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(\\,\\cdot\\,;\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch20/58-df-projective-variety.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md","status":"resolved","id":"07ee726a6e15b274","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_{(\\cdot)}(\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-algebraic-group.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,A,m,i,e\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(\\,\\cdot\\,;\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AlgGroup}_{(\\cdot)}(\\,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot,\\cdot):V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}abelian\\text{-}variety} \\vdash \\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m,i,e) \\leftrightarrow \\mathrm{AlgGroup}_k(A,m,i,e)\\land\\exists P,\\tau_Z\\in V\\;\\exists n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\\Bigl(\\operatorname{ProjectiveVariety}_S(A;P,k,n,\\tau_Z)\\land\\forall a,b\\in A\\;\\bigl(m(\\langle a,b\\rangle)=m(\\langle b,a\\rangle)\\bigr)\\Bigr)","display":true},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"A \\cong \\mathbb{C}^g/\\Lambda","display":false},{"tex":"H^1(A, \\mathcal{O}) \\cong \\mathbb{C}^g","display":false},{"tex":"g=1","display":false},{"tex":"g = g(C)","display":false}],"bytes":1544,"backlinks":[{"id":"0d74e4cb72d4ed4c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"bf97099d9a48be46","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S:V^5\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md]])"},{"id":"41289d25523036d5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{AbelianVar}_S(k,A,m_A,i_A,e_A)$ (abelian-variety predicate, see [[58-df-abelian-variety]])"},{"id":"3311bfe05245f437","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-301","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-abelian-variety]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-101","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-abelian-variety.md|58-df-abelian-variety]]（batch18）"}],"outgoing":["6046552157f71d9c","07ee726a6e15b274"]}